BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Earth's Most Venomous Snakes\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261122T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261122T144500
UID:1c06b7c0d069ec43514f60111d694b6d@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join the park naturalist at the Brown County State Park Nature
  Center for a presentation and discussion about snakes and their venom. Le
 arn what types of venom are found in Indiana&#39\;s four species of venomo
 us snakes and how these snakes compare to the rest of the world!
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center program room\, 1405 S.R. 
 46 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
