UID:8f1a2bf063e0a281941aeabdb5df7b4e@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a short\, ADA accessible hike on th
 e Friends&#39\; Trail. See a vista you can&#39\;t drive to\, walk past a h
 istoric park gatehouse\, and learn about the work Friends groups do for In
 diana State Parks! The Friends&#39\; Trail is considered easy\, with a dis
 tance less than half a mile\, all paved sidewalk or wooden boardwalk and n
 o stairs.
